  "review": [
    "Native EDI stores RegisterTimer EAX at E29CA1 and remains callee-saved through both cleanup exits; E29CF9 pushes EDI before conditional branch to E29DB9. Standard call-window IR cannot traverse this split; exact full-function bytes plus aligned CFG prove both timer release paths.",
    "Objective native arguments: active quest return, frame12 objective text, frame16 empty region1, frame20 NorthernWastes3 region2. Reminder flags are true,true; completion flags false,false,false; deactivation delay0.",
    "Ego_r PDB CQS_ScytheInfoScript has single own bool MissionSucceeded at debug0x5C; retail Init writes false at0x48, Main polls it, and E2A5D9 writes true through parent. Cross-build member name is secondary evidence; retail offsets derive from bytes. FableWin Main local SnowspireReminder is CTimer."
  ],
